<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n49752" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἰατρ-ικός</span></b> , 
			Ion.
		
		<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἰητρ-</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ή</span>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">όν</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>of</i> or <i>for an</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἰατρός, καρκίνος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>IG</u>
					22.47.16
				</span></i>
			
			<span class="entity">(iv B.C.)</span>: <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-ικόν</span> (sc.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τέλος</span>), τό, tax <i>for maintenance of doctor</i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>SIG</u>
				437
			</span></i> (Delph., <span class="entity">iii B.C.</span>), <i><span class="en">
				<u>PSI</u>
				4.371
			</span></i>,<i><span class="en">
				388
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(iii B.C.)</span>; so perh. 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰ ἰατρικά</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>PCair.Zen.</u>
					36.4
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				13
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(iii B.C.)</span>; but <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-ικόν, τό</span>, Milit., <i>medical
			corps</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Arr.
				<u>Tact.</u>
				2.1
			</span></i>: <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡ -κή</span> (sc. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τέχνη</span>), <i>surgery, medicine</i>,
				<i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				2.84
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				3.129
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>VM</u>
				1
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Grg.</u>
				478b
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Epicur.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				221
			</span></i>, etc. Adv.
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-κῶς</span>
			<i>in medical terms</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐκφέρεσθαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Phld.
					<u>Po.</u>
					5.29
				</span></i>
			, etc. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>skilled in the medical art</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>R.</u>
				455e
			</span></i>, etc.; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἰ. ἐκ τῶν συγγραμμάτων
				γίνεσθαι</span> by rule, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>EN</u>
				1181b2
			</span></i>, etc.: 
				Comp.
			
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-ώτερος</span> ib.<i><span class="en">
				1097a10
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-ώτερον τῶν ἰατρικῶν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Phld.
					<u>Mus.</u>
					p.6
				</span></i>
			 K.: 
				Sup.
			
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-ώτατος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Smp.</u>
					186d
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				<u>Protr.</u>
				10
			</span></i>. Adv.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-κῶς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Alex.
					124.13
				</span></i>
			, etc. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> metaph., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἰ. περὶ τὴν ψυχήν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Prt.</u>
					313e
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b> of drugs,
				<i>efficacious</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φάρμακα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hp.
					<u>Ep.</u>
					16
				</span></i>
			 (
				Sup.
			). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἰατρικός</span> (sc. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δάκτυλος</span>), ὁ,
				<i>forefinger,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				PLond.
				1821.300
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
